The data from plants (Arabidopsis) GWAS is freely around, also with some
nice phenotypes (compliments to Susanna Atwell, Magnus Nordborg, et al.,
for making this public, see
http://www.nature.com/nature/journal/v465/n7298/full/nature08800.html).
